msgstr ""

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind [ScriptStruct ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind [ScriptStruct ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind"
msgid "パラメトリック合成風。UE の WindDirectionalSource に依存しない。\n合成式: Total = (SteadyForce + Oscillation + Wave) × Envelope + Random + Gust（Gust は TriggerProceduralWindGust API から発生）\nParametric synthesized wind. This does not depend on UE WindDirectionalSource.\nComposition: Total = (SteadyForce + Oscillation + Wave) x Envelope + Random + Gust (Gust is triggered via the TriggerProceduralWindGust API)."
msgstr "パラメトリック合成風。UE の WindDirectionalSource に依存しない。\n合成式: Total = (SteadyForce + Oscillation + Wave) × Envelope + Random + Gust（Gust は TriggerProceduralWindGust API から発生）"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:DirectionNoiseAngle
