#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:DirectionNoiseAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:DirectionNoiseAngle"
msgid "Direction Noise Angle"
msgstr "風向きの揺らぎ角"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:DirectionNoiseAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:DirectionNoiseAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:DirectionNoiseAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:DirectionNoiseAngle"
msgid "風向き自体の揺らぎの円錐半角。向きの単調さを消す\nCone half-angle of the wind direction wander. Breaks directional monotony."
msgstr "風向き自体の揺らぎの円錐半角。向きの単調さを消す"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:DirectionNoisePeriod
