#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeFrequency [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeFrequency"
msgid "Envelope Frequency"
msgstr "エンベロープ周波数"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeFrequency
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeFrequency [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeFrequency [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeFrequency"
msgid "うねりの速さ（Hz）。低いほどゆったり。Wind Scope の Envelope 系列に対応\nSwell speed in Hz. Lower is slower. Corresponds to the Envelope series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "うねりの速さ（Hz）。低いほどゆったり。Wind Scope の Envelope 系列に対応"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMax
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMax [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMax [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMax"
msgid "Envelope Max"
msgstr "エンベロープ最大倍率"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMax
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMax [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMax [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMax"
msgid "風全体の強弱のうねり（低周波変調）の上限倍率。Min を下げると凪↔強風の緩急が生まれる。Min=Max=1 で無効。Wind Scope の Envelope 系列に対応\nUpper multiplier of the slow global intensity swell. Lower Min creates calm-to-gust dynamics. Disabled when Min=Max=1. Corresponds to the Envelope series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "風全体の強弱のうねり（低周波変調）の上限倍率。Min を下げると凪↔強風の緩急が生まれる。Min=Max=1 で無効。Wind Scope の Envelope 系列に対応"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMin
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMin [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMin [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMin"
msgid "Envelope Min"
msgstr "エンベロープ最小倍率"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMin
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMin [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMin [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopeMin"
msgid "風全体の強弱のうねり（低周波変調）の下限倍率。Min を下げると凪↔強風の緩急が生まれる。Min=Max=1 で無効。Wind Scope の Envelope 系列に対応\nLower multiplier of the slow global intensity swell. Lower Min creates calm-to-gust dynamics. Disabled when Min=Max=1. Corresponds to the Envelope series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "風全体の強弱のうねり（低周波変調）の下限倍率。Min を下げると凪↔強風の緩急が生まれる。Min=Max=1 で無効。Wind Scope の Envelope 系列に対応"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopePhase
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopePhase [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopePhase [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopePhase"
msgid "Envelope Phase"
msgstr "エンベロープ位相"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopePhase
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopePhase [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopePhase [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:EnvelopePhase"
msgid "エンベロープ（強弱のうねり）の開始位相オフセット。複数キャラや複数外力のうねりタイミングをずらす用途。Wind Scope の Envelope 系列に対応\nStart phase offset of the envelope (strength undulation). Use to stagger envelope timing across multiple characters or external forces. Corresponds to the Envelope series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "エンベロープ（強弱のうねり）の開始位相オフセット。複数キャラや複数外力のうねりタイミングをずらす用途。Wind Scope の Envelope 系列に対応"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:ForceRateByBoneLengthRate
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:ForceRateByBoneLengthRate [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:ForceRateByBoneLengthRate [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:ForceRateByBoneLengthRate"
msgid "Force Rate by Bone Length Rate"
msgstr "ボーン長割合によるForce Rate補正"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:ForceRateByBoneLengthRate
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:ForceRateByBoneLengthRate [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:ForceRateByBoneLengthRate [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:ForceRateByBoneLengthRate"
msgid "各ボーンに適用するForce Rateを補正。\n「RootBoneから特定のボーンまでの長さ / RootBoneから末端のボーンまでの長さ」(0.0~1.0)の値におけるカーブの値をForceRateに乗算\nCorrects the Force Rate applied to each bone.\nMultiplies the ForceRate by the curve value for \"Length from RootBone to specific bone / Length from RootBone to end bone\" (0.0~1.0)"
msgstr "各ボーンに適用するForce Rateを補正。\n「RootBoneから特定のボーンまでの長さ / RootBoneから末端のボーンまでの長さ」(0.0~1.0)の値におけるカーブの値をForceRateに乗算"

